commons_photos.description:
Finnish Tatars in Tampere, 1933 October. Celebrating the 10-year anniversary of Turkey in the festive hall of VPK. Behind, flags of Turkey and Finland and pictures of presidents of both countries. 
In the picture:
Sitting on the floor, from left;
Abdul Halid Bedretdin, Abdul Hamid Bedretdin, Semiulla Hakimsan, Zinnetulla Hakimsan, Mensur Baibulat, Refat Neuman, Lotfi Nasibulla, Esad Baibulat, Hamdurrahman Hakimsan.
First row;
Kadriye Wafin, Alime Ibrahim, Naile Wafin, Halide Ibrahim, Halide Bedretdin, Habibe Bedretdin, Gölsöm Wafin, Gibadulla Murtasin, Tevhide Neuman, Emine Muhammedshan, Muazzez Baibulat, Äkram Neuman, Halid Korbangali, Hanäfi Korbangali, Hafize Hakimsan, Aliye Hakimsan, Zekiye Muhammedshan.
Second row;
Hairulla Alautdin, Fatima &amp; Husein Neuman, Shämsökamer &amp; Ahmedshan Hudaibirdi, Imad &amp; Fatima Samaletdin, Zeliha &amp; Ymär Sali, Ibrahim &amp; Halime Hakimsan, Feriha &amp; Ahmedshan Muhammedshan.
Third row;
Ismail Neuman, Ymär &amp; Merziya Nasibulla, Faize Bedretdin, Mörshide Bedretdin, Zinnetullah &amp; Möshfika Wafin, Camaletdin &amp; Zeineb Baibulat, Mahira &amp; Neuman Nasibulla, Halise &amp; Letfulla Baibulat, Aisja &amp; Sylvi Hakimsan.
Fourth row;
Mersiaf Korbangali, Abdulla ?, Camaletdin Bilaletdin, Abbas &amp; Mönire Bedretdin, Galiye &amp; Ismail Ibrahim, Abdulla &amp; Fatiha Alautdin, Ahmedcan Samaletdin.
Standing next to flags;
Fatih Hudaibirdi, Ymär Talus, Jarulla Alautdin, Mehrusa &amp; Semiulla Wafin, Naim Nasibulla, Ymär Kurbanali.
Standing behind;
Zeki Samaletdin, Zekiye Nasibulla, Halide Wafin, Aliye Wafin, Bibican Hudaibirdi, Halide Baibulat, Halime Neuman, Mönire Ibrahim, Hadiçe Hudaibirdi, Fatima Wafin, Halide Samaletdin, Raziye Hairetdin, Saniye Muhammedshan. 

Peeping at the door is Musa Carullah Bigi (Musa Bigiyev), who did not want the Soviet Union to find out he was staying in Finland due to fearing it might have consequences on his family which was living in there.
